<title>BELGIUM: TER BEKE H1 NET PROFIT FALLS 15.5 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TER BEKE H1 NET PROFIT FALLS 15.5 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in</p>
<p>millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales	 2,587.0 vs 2,576.3</p>
<p>    Cons current profit	    75.4 vs    91.5</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		  60.1 vs    83.1</p>
<p>    Minorities			  0.0 vs    12.0</p>
<p>    Group net profit		 60.1 vs    71.1</p>
<p>    Cash flow			 158.4 vs   222.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Ter Beke is a Belgian processed meats and ready made</p>
<p>meals maker.</p>
</text>
